strsimpy-rust: Rust mirror of luozhouyang/python-string-similarity
============================================================================

This directory holds the rustsmith Stage-1 mirror of
https://github.com/luozhouyang/python-string-similarity (string similarity
and distance library).

* Upstream author: ZhouYang Luo <zhouyang.luo@gmail.com>
* Upstream license: MIT (full text: LICENSE-MIT where vendored; SPDX tag
  carried in every file header).
* This port: behavior-identical, same public API (`strsimpy._strsimpy`
  extension module plus the `strsimpy/__init__.py` re-export shim),
  published as the `strsimpy-rust` distribution on PyPI (import name
  unchanged: `import strsimpy`) with reusable core crate
  `strsimpy-rust-core` on crates.io.

Provenance: every artifact preserves the upstream license header and this
attribution (provenance gate). See `release.toml` for the publishing
configuration and `docs/RELEASE.md` for the release procedure.
